sequenceDiagram
    participant HostApp as Consuming Laravel App
    participant RM as Revision Manager
    participant MR as Model Registry
    participant BI as BPMN Interpreter
    participant ES as Event Store

    HostApp->>RM: transition(entity, event)
    RM->>MR: resolve current model revision
    MR-->>RM: BPMN model definition
    RM->>BI: drive(entity, model, event)
    BI-->>RM: new state
    RM->>ES: append TransitionEvent
    ES-->>RM: ack
    RM-->>HostApp: new state
